'''Venomous Duck''' is the only stage in '''Oddity in the Desert''', which appears after clearing [[Badlands Area 4]]. It drops no items, but unlocks stages 5-10 of [[Ashvini Desert]] when cleared. It was added in [[Version 11.6 Update|Version 11.6]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

